First public release of InvokeCordon.

Included
- Static scanner: four detection rules, 0-100 score, A-F grade, text/json/markdown reports
- Runtime proxy: JSON-RPC gateway with monitor and enforce modes
- Policy engine: YAML tool rules plus recursive argument checks for path traversal, shell metacharacters, and cloud metadata
- Redaction: recursive secret stripping from tool arguments before forwarding
- Audit: concurrent-safe JSONL log storing SHA-256 payload hashes, never raw payloads
- Metrics: Prometheus endpoint at /metrics
- Benchmarks: k6, 20 VUs, 30s, avg 790 microseconds, p95 2.26ms, 0 percent errors

Known limitations
- HTTP JSON-RPC transport only
- Pattern-based detection, not exhaustive
- Does not address model-level prompt injection
